{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43565","headline":"花下醉中联句 · 李绦","name":"花下醉中联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共醉风光地，花飞落酒杯。\n残春犹可赏，晚景莫相催。\n酒幸年年有，花应岁岁开。\n且当金韵掷，莫遣玉山颓。\n高会弥堪惜，良时不易陪。\n谁能拉花住，争换得春回。\n我辈寻常有，佳人早晚来。\n寄言三相府，欲散且裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43565.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43565","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}